1
00:00:00,024 --> 00:00:01,062
Ben Goes Fishing
本去钓鱼

2
00:00:01,064 --> 00:00:02,662
Ben and his dad went fishing
Ben和他爸爸去钓鱼了

3
00:00:02,664 --> 00:00:03,875
Ben took the pole
Ben拿了杆子

4
00:00:03,984 --> 00:00:05,835
His dad took some worms
他爸爸吃了些虫子

5
00:00:06,184 --> 00:00:07,262
They got on a boat
他们上了船

6
00:00:07,264 --> 00:00:08,875
The boat was in Pine Lake
船在松树湖

7
00:00:08,944 --> 00:00:10,675
Ben's dad drove the boat
Ben的爸爸开的船

8
00:00:10,984 --> 00:00:12,503
He knows where to find the fish
他知道鱼在哪

9
00:00:12,503 --> 00:00:14,022
Ben liked the boat ride
Ben喜欢坐船

10
00:00:14,023 --> 00:00:15,663
Ben put a worm on the hook
Ben在钩子上放了条虫子

11
00:00:15,663 --> 00:00:17,074
He put his line in the water
他把鱼线放到水里

12
00:00:17,423 --> 00:00:18,742
He felt the pole pull
他感觉到了杆子的拉力

13
00:00:18,743 --> 00:00:20,594
Was it a fish?
是鱼吗？

14
00:00:20,623 --> 00:00:21,675
He reeled it in
他把它卷了进来

15
00:00:21,783 --> 00:00:22,954
He did not get a fish
他没有得到一条鱼

16
00:00:23,103 --> 00:00:24,234
Ben got an old can
Ben有个旧罐子

